scription":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["deadly-3d12","magical","reach-20","unarmed"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.ZrnTtQzYoMMf79j0"},{"_id":"yPMc4avP8IHjveQY","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"constant-spells","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.yPMc4avP8IHjveQY"},{"_id":"VVvneLCIn09BPxX7","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Erosion Aura","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>120 feet.</p>\n<p>The guthallath erodes away the physical integrity of all around it. Creatures and objects in the emanation other than the guthallath have their Hardness and resistances reduced by 10.</p>\n<p>At the start of their turn, a creature in the erosion aura's area takes @Damage[6d6[bludgeoning]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:39|basic] save.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":120,"slug":"erosion-aura","traits":["primal"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.VVvneLCIn09BPxX7"},{"_id":"nCvEdtYwtDcpBscl","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Immunity to Magic","sort":900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>The guthallath is immune to spells of 6th rank or lower and activations of magic items of 13th level or lower.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.nCvEdtYwtDcpBscl"},{"_id":"D0q0aNWo1X51cNe4","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Annihilation Beams","sort":1000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A guthallath releases two beams of destruction from its eyes. Each beam is a @Template[line|distance:120]. Everything in either line takes @Damage[13d10[untyped]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:41|basic|options:area-effect] save.</p>\n<p>A creature reduced to 0 HP is reduced to a fine powder as the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate} spell. There is no additional effect on creatures in any area where the beams overlap.</p>\n<p>The guthallath can't use this ability again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Annihilation Beams]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.D0q0aNWo1X51cNe4"},{"_id":"tDvcon2bK9xEGh90","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Deadly Throw","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The guthallath has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The guthallath throws the creature into the air, 100 feet high and 50 feet away. If the flung creature lands on another creature, the creature it lands on takes the same amount of bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<p>The creature being landed on can attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:41|basic] save.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.tDvcon2bK9xEGh90"},{"_id":"v8RLawIxRUNc3rnR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Powerful Blows","sort":1200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>If a guthallath hits with an attack and rolls a natural 19 on the d20 roll, the attack is a critical hit. This has no effect if the 19 would be a failure.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[{"adjustment":{"success":"to-critical-success"},"key":"AdjustDegreeOfSuccess","predicate":["check:total:natural:19",{"gte":["check:total:delta",0]}],"selector":"strike-attack-roll"},{"key":"Note","predicate":["check:total:natural:19",{"not":{"gte":["check:total","check:total:delta"]}}],"selector":"strike-attack-roll","text":"{item|description}","title":"{item|name}"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.v8RLawIxRUNc3rnR"},{"_id":"pSI2QoLhvn9RpREJ","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.UNah0bxXxkcZjxO3"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/ThreeActions.webp","name":"Trample","sort":1300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Huge or smaller, foot, @Check[reflex|dc:45|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Trample]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"trample","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.pSI2QoLhvn9RpREJ"},{"_id":"ByItiXXLE0ZzOvm8","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.i18TlebMzwONyPhI"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Grab","sort":1400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-grab","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.ByItiXXLE0ZzOvm8"},{"_id":"qa0M1ZbNy1NNa2x3","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.LbnsT8yXchHMQT3t"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Knockdown","sort":1500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedKnockdown]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-knockdown","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.qa0M1ZbNy1NNa2x3"},{"_id":"Uzinvon7QqcS48NH","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.6l7e7CHQLESlI57U"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Push 20 feet","sort":1600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedPush]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-push","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN.Uzinvon7QqcS48NH"}],"name":"Guthallath","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":-1},"con":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":-4},"str":{"mod":10},"wis":{"mod":0}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":43},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":325,"temp":0,"value":325},"immunities":[],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":["adamantine"],"type":"physical","value":15},{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":["cold","earth","water"],"type":"spells","value":15}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":50}],"value":40}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":19},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>A guthallath is an enormous construct created long ago, probably as a war machine, by a long-forgotten empire. Nearly 100 feet tall, this massive stone statue typically resembles a stalwart warrior wearing only a loincloth and skullcap. Few have seen the entire body of a guthallath, though; most of the time, the relic is buried up to its neck, covered in moss, and stranded in a forgotten place. Yet every so often, one of these harbingers of destruction reactivates in response to some unknown stimulus or rallying call, and when this happens, woe to any who stand in its way.</p>\n<p>While a guthallath's ancient enemies are likely gone, it's still an engine of pure destruction, designed to rampage for weeks, even months. It's not intelligent enough to enjoy or regret its acts and cannot be reasoned with—it's also unaffected by most magic and unpredictable in how it selects its targets (and the creatures it spares).</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":30,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"precise","range":60,"type":"truesight"}]},"resources":{"focus":{"max":1,"value":1}},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":38},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":32},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":30}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":25},"athletics":{"base":40}},"traits":{"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"grg"},"value":["construct"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.BPznJcLvfkpfeQ2q"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!zW4Wn0w7DtsckdjN","folder":null,"prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-monster-core/guthallath.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"pathfinder_monster_core__guthallath","